@startuml
Consenter -> Consenter: Complete and sign the consent form
Consenter -> Consenter: Derive a computer Consent Resource from the form
Consenter -> "Consent Server System": Transmit the Consent Resource and the consent form
"Consent Server System" -> "Consent Server System": Store Consent Resource and the original consent form
"Consent Server System" -> Consenter: Confirm activation of the consent
@enduml
